WEBVTT

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:02.337
Another federal deadline.

00:00:02.370 --> 00:00:04.677
Another SF330 scramble.

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:05.817
Meet Rhodo!

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:08.877
It watches SAM.gov for work that fits your firm.

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:10.457
Reads every solicitation.

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:13.057
Scores your fit… and shows you why.

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:15.287
Your strongest projects? Found!

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:16.987
The right people? Matched!

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.217
Your experience matrix? Built!

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:22.287
It drafts the resumes, project sheets, and narratives.

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:25.077
Correct it once… It remembers.

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:26.727
Your whole SF330.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:27.556
Assembled.

00:00:27.589 --> 00:00:28.707
Ready for review!

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:30.257
AI does the groundwork.

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:31.990
Your team makes the calls.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:33.267
Rhodo!

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:36.350
From SAM.gov… to a winning proposal!
